# `ios/` IS committed as of 0.3.0: it is the Swift Package Manager verification
# leg (`cap add ios --packagemanager SPM`), built by CI's verify-ios job
# alongside demo/ios's CocoaPods build. `ios/.gitignore`, shipped by Capacitor's
# own template, already excludes the machine-specific parts (App/build, Pods,
# DerivedData, xcuserdata, App/App/public, the generated config files).
#
# `android/` stays ignored — demo/android is the Android verification leg, and a
# second Gradle project would only duplicate it.
android/

